data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","sequence_number":162,"item_id":"msg_07e34b6734dd74e3016ae220bd9aec81918922a82341f069bd","output_index":2,"content_index":0,"text":"{\"decision\":\"clarify\",\"rationale\":\"The report supplies the environment, override configuration, plugin-registration toggle and both errors, including their differing effects on .ts and .js files. However, it spreads the configuration returned by `feEslint` from `@fe/eslint-config`, whose implementation and dependency records are absent. Reconstructing the inherited plugin registrations and file scopes is necessary to reproduce these configuration-merging errors; the supplied supporting text adds no relevant setup.\",\"clarification\":\"Could you share the relevant configuration implementation exported by `@fe/eslint-config`, together with the relevant `package.json` and lockfile, or a minimal project containing them? These are needed to reconstruct the inherited configuration and plugin dependency setup behind the two reported errors.\"}","logprobs":[]}

